<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2PE" style="id">- Sefwi New Testament</book>
  <para style="h">2 PETRO</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Pe</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Petro</para>
  <para style="toc1">PETRO NWOMAA BƆ ƆTƆ SO NYƆ</para>
  <para style="mt1">PETRO</para>
  <para style="mt4">NWOMAA BƆ ƆTƆ SO NYƆ</para>
  <para style="ip">Petro krataa bɔ ɔtɔ so nyɔ ne, né ye atirimbɔ yeɛ ole kyɛ ɔfa kõ tia akyerɛkyerɛfoɛ bɔ bɛnga nahorɛ, ɔne nningyein tɛɛ bɔ ofi bɛ ngyerɛkyerɛ nanu ba ne. Petro hane Kristofoɛ ngyerɛkyerɛ bɔ bahyeɛhyea ye nanwo dwirɛ, na ɔmaa ye atiefoɛ ne nwuni kyɛ Kristo walɛ ne, ɔtte anansesɛm bie. Nikye kõ bɔ ɔfa sili so dua yeɛ ole mmerɛ bɔ Kristo sakrale ye nwo wɔ bɛ nyunu wɔ bokaa naso ne. (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2PE 1:17-18">2Pe 1:17-18</ref></char>) Petro hyirele nu kyɛ, nikye komapɛ yeɛ ɔkɔhora kɔhõ kotia ngondombo ngyerɛkyerɛ ɔ, na ɛhene yeɛ ole Bible nanu nahorɛ bɔ yɛkosua ne.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ɔmaa yɛnwuni kyɛ nzɛmba ne te kyɛ “kanea bɔ ɔta awosii nu” ne. (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2PE 1:19">2Pe 1:19</ref></char>) Afei, yeti nza nanu ne, Petro maa yɛnwuni bɔ okosi awieɛ mmerɛ nanu ɔ. Ɔmaa yɛnwuni kyɛ ne mmenia bɔ bɛka ayinga kɔgoro Kristofoɛ nanwo wɔ Kristo walɛ nanwo. (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2PE 3:3-5">2Pe 3:3-5</ref></char>) Nakoso kyɛbɔ Nyameɛ fale nzue sɛkyele mmenia bɔ ne bɛwɔ Nowa aberɛ so ne, sɔ ala yeɛ ɔkɔsɛkye ɛhemɔ ɔ.—<char style="xt"><ref loc="2PE 3:5-7">2Pe 3:5-7</ref>.</char></para>
  <para style="ip">Yeti, mmerɛ bɔ yɛnwondɛ kyɛ ɛhemɔ kɔwa nu ne, odikyɛ yɛmaa y'abrabɔ nwo te, na yɛfa nyamesom pa yɛtena ase. Osa hyirele nu kyɛ, bɔ ɔmaa yɛnwu ye kyɛ Nyameɛ ahyɛ yeɛ ole kyɛ, onguro kyɛ ebiala kɔsɛkye.—<char style="xt"><ref loc="2PE 3:9-13">2Pe 3:9-13</ref>.</char></para>
  <para style="ip">Somafoɛ Petro krataa he koso, ɔhworɔle ye wɔ Babilon kɔyɛ afoɛ 64 Y.A.<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Y.A ne kyire “Yɛ Aberɛ so,” Brɔfo </char><char style="it">Common Era</char> anaa <char style="it">C.E.</char></note></para>
  <para style="ib" />
  <para style="iot">ENU DWIRƐ</para>
  <para style="io1">Ngyeaa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2PE 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Kristofoɛ bɔ baye bɛ ne (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2PE 1:3-21">1:3-21</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ngondombo akyerɛkyerɛfoɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2PE 2:1-22">2:1-22</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Kristo walɛ bɔ ɔtɔ so nyɔ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2PE 3:1-18">3:1-18</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="ib" />
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2PE 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 1:1" />Simon Petro, Yesu Kristo akoaa ne somafoɛ,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 1:1">metworɔ krataa he mebrɛ bɛ bɔ ɔnate yɛ Nyameɛ ne Agyenkwa Yesu Kristo tenenee ti, banya gyidie bɔ ɔsom bo te kyɛ yɛ deɛ ne:<verse eid="2PE 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 1:2" />Adom ne asomdwie bɔ ɔnate Nyameɛ ne y'Awurade Yesu nwo nahorɛ nimdeɛ naso ne bu ɛmɔ so.<verse eid="2PE 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 1:3" />Nyameɛ tumi ti, yanya nikye biala bɔ ɔfa ngoa ne nyamesom pa nwo nate Nyameɛ nwo nahorɛ nimdeɛ so; Ye yeɛ wafa ye anuonyam ne ye pa wafrɛ yɛ. <verse eid="2PE 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 1:4" />Na ɔnate ɛhemɔ so ahyɛ yɛ bɔ mbiri-mbiri bɔ ɔsom bo, na mmerɛ bɔ ɛmɔ anwati bafi wiase bɔ akɔnnɔ bɔne ama waporɔ he anu ne, ɛmɔ nate ɛhemɔ so anya Nyameɛ suban ne bie.<verse eid="2PE 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 1:5" />Ye sɔ nati, ɛmɔbɔ mmɔden bɛfa bra pa bɛboka ɛmɔ gyidie so, ɛmɔfa nimdeɛ bɛboka ɛmɔ bra pa so, <verse eid="2PE 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 1:6" />ɛmɔfa ahohyɛsoɛ bɛboka ɛmɔ nimdeɛ so, ɛmɔfa aboterɛ bɛboka ɛmɔ ahohyɛsoɛ so, ɛmɔfa nyamesom pa bɛboka ɛmɔ aboterɛ so, <verse eid="2PE 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 1:7" />aboterɛ ne si ne, ɛmɔdodɔ aliemaa mɔ, na ɛmɔnya ɔdɔ bɛma ebiala. <verse eid="2PE 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 1:8" />Sɛ ɛmɔnya sɔ suban hemɔ maa obu so a, ɛmɔ kɔfa Awurade Yesu Kristo nwo nahorɛ nimdeɛ ne bɛkɔyɛ adwuma. Kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, ɛmɔngɔtena berɛ mbaen, anaa ɛmɔngɔyɛ mmenia bɔ bɛnzu mmaa ɔ. <verse eid="2PE 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 1:9" />Na sona biala bɔ olle sɔ suban hemɔ ne, ye nye asi, onguro kyɛ onwu kanea ne, na ye wora afi kyɛ banwunzi ye nwo bafi bɔne bɔ wayɛ ye daa nanwo. <verse eid="2PE 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 1:10" />Yeti aliemaa mɔ, ɛmɔbɔ mmɔden bɛtira asaa bɔ bato bafrɛ ɛmɔ nanu yé, na sɛ ɛmɔkɔ so bɛyɛ sɔ a, ɛmɔngofi ase lle. <verse eid="2PE 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 1:11" />Nahorɛ dwirɛ yeɛ ole kyɛ, ɔkɔmaa ɛmɔ konya ye nwo atee bɛkɔhɔ y'Awurade ne y'Agyenkwa Yesu Kristo Ahennie bɔ ɔwɔ berɛ daa nanu.<verse eid="2PE 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 1:12" />Yeti yeɛ daa mepena kyɛ mekaye ɛmɔ sɔ nningyein hemɔ ne, ɔwɔ nu ɛmɔse, na ɛmɔ bo atimu wɔ nahorɛ nanu. <verse eid="2PE 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 1:13" />Nakoso mmerɛ bɔ nwɔ nipadua<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngyerɛaseɛ Tee: “Nde tɛnt he anu ne.”</char></note> he anu ne de, menwu ye kyɛ odikyɛ mekɔ so mekaye ɛmɔ, <verse eid="2PE 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 1:14" />ofikyɛ mese kyɛ ɔngɔhyɛ, bɛkɔye sɔ nipadua<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngyerɛaseɛ Tee: “Tɛnt.”</char></note> he be kogua berɛ, kyɛbɔ y'Awurade Yesu Kristo ha hyirele me ne. <verse eid="2PE 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 1:15" />Na mepena kyɛ meyɛ bɔ ngɔhora biala, na sɛ mekɔ a, ɛmɔ akaye sɔ nningyein he daa biala.<verse eid="2PE 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 1:16" />Amba, y'Awurade Yesu Kristo tumi ne ye walɛ nanwo dwirɛ bɔ yɛha yɛhyirele ɛmɔ ne, ɔtte anansesɛm bie yeɛ yɛto yɛhyirele ɛmɔ ɔ, mmom yɛ bɔbɔ yɛfale yɛ nye yɛnwuni ye anuonyam ne. <verse eid="2PE 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 1:17" />Onyane anuonyam ne nidie fili Baba Nyameɛ berɛ, mmerɛ bɔ Onuoyamfoɛ Kandinga ne hane edwirɛ he hyirele ye ne: “Ɛhe yeɛ ole mma bɔ medɔ ye, ná malɛ́ ye mato nu ne.” <verse eid="2PE 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 1:18" />Mmerɛ bɔ yɛne ye wɔ bokaa krongron naso ne, ɛhe yeɛ ole konviɛ bɔ yɛte yɛfili anwuro ne.<verse eid="2PE 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 1:19" />Ngɔmhyɛ dwirɛ ne koso, wamaa yanwu kyɛ ɔte nahorɛ paa; na ɔte pa kyɛ ɛmɔ kɔmaa ɛmɔ nye kɔhɔ ye nwo, te kyɛ kanea bɔ ɔta awosii nu wɔ ɛmɔ ahone nu (kodwu kyɛ aleɛ kɔhye, ná ngyerɛmɔ nzramaa afite) ne. <verse eid="2PE 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 1:20" />Bɔ oli moa koraa ne, ɛmɔse kyɛ Tworɔnzɛm nanu ngɔmhyɛ biala nne berɛ bɔ ofi sona ndeaseɛ nu ɔ. <verse eid="2PE 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 1:21" />Nná sona berɛ yeɛ ngɔmhyɛ fi ba ɔ, mmom kyɛbɔ honhom krongron ne hane bɛ ne, yeɛ bɛhane ɔ.<verse eid="2PE 1:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2PE 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 2:1" />Na kyɛbɔ adiifoɛ bɔ bɛnga nahorɛ wale bɛ nu ne, sɔ ala yeɛ akyerɛkyerɛfoɛ bɔ bɛnga nahorɛ kɔwa ɛmɔ nu ɔ. Bekowia bɛ nwo bɛkɔɔtete kue bɔ ɔsɛkye mmenia, bɛkɔha kyɛ bɛnze bɛ wura bɔ ɔtɔle bɛ ne po, na ɛhe kɔmaa bɛkɔsɛkye bɛ ndɛ. <verse eid="2PE 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 2:2" />Mmeni pee koli bɛ san-nza-mmra ne si, na ɛhe kɔmaa bɛkɔkeka edwirɛ tɛɛ bɛkɔfa nahorɛ nanwo. <verse eid="2PE 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 2:3" />Bɛ nye bɔ ɔboro nikye nati, bɛkɔfa nnaka-naka so bɛkodidi ɛmɔ nwo. Nakoso bɛ atemmuo bɔ ɔla berɛ fi tete ne, ɔngɔhyɛ, na kyɛbɔ ɔte biala ne, bɛkɔsɛkye bɛ.<verse eid="2PE 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 2:4" />Abɔfo bɔ bɛyɛle bɔne ne, Nyameɛ amva bɛ nwo angyɛ bɛ, mmom ɔtole bɛ guale <char style="tl">Tartarus</char>, ná wafa kyenyi wakyekye bɛ wagua awosii tumm nu, bɔ bɛnwondɛ atemmuo. <verse eid="2PE 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 2:5" />Ná tete wiase ne, wamva bɛ nwo wangyɛ bɛ, mmom ɔmaa nzue yi sɛkyele amumuyɛfoɛ ne; nakoso olɛle Nowa bɔ ɔhane tenenee nwo nzɛmba ne, ɔne mmenia nzoo bɔ bɛboka ye so ne. <verse eid="2PE 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 2:6" />Afei, obuli Sodom ne Gomora nguro ne fɔ sɛkyele bɛ maa bɛkakyile nzoen, na wafa wayɛ sɛnnahɔ wama amumuyɛfoɛ. <verse eid="2PE 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 2:7" />Ná ɔpepɛ lɛle teneneeniɛ Lot bɔ amumuyɛfoɛ ne san-nza-mmra ne maa ye nwo yerɛ-yerale ye ne. <verse eid="2PE 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 2:8" />Ofikyɛ daa biala mmenia bɔ né teneneeniɛ ne te bɛ nu ne, bɛ nneyɛɛ tɛɛ bɔ né onwu ye na ɔte ne, ɔmaa ye kra bɔ ɔtengyɛ ne nwo yerɛ-yerale ye. <verse eid="2PE 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 2:9" />Ɛhe amukoraati maa yɛnwu kyɛ, Awurade se kyɛbɔ okole bɛ bɔ bɛsuro ye ne kofi nzɔhwɛ nu, ná waboɔboa bɛ bɔ bɛndengyɛ ne noa wama atemmuda. <verse eid="2PE 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 2:10" />Ye titire ne, bɛ bɔ bafa basie bɛ nye so kyɛ bɛkogua mmenia nwo fiɛ, na bɛbu tumidie animtia ne.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 2:10">Sɔ mmenia ne nye yɛ se, bɛdi b'ahone so dwirɛ, na bɛnzuro kyɛ bɛkɔha edwirɛ bekotia bɛ bɔ bɛle anuonyam ne. <verse eid="2PE 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 2:11" />Ɔwɔ nu, abɔfo le tumi ne anwoserɛ paa, nakoso bɛngeka edwirɛ bɛmva bɛmmu bɛ atɛn, ofikyɛ bɛsuro Awurade.<verse eid="2PE 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 2:12" />Sɔ mmenia hemɔ te kyɛ ngaka bɔ adwene nne bɛ ti anu, ná atenga yeɛ bɛfa bɛyɛ bɛ nikye ne; bɛ deɛ ala yeɛ ole kyɛ bɛhye bɛ na bɛhu bɛ. Nikye biala bɔ bɛnde yebo ne,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Bɛnze ne.”</char></note> bɛdwudwo betia. Atee bɔ bɛnate so nala yeɛ ɔkɔsɛkye bɛ ɔ. <verse eid="2PE 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 2:13" />Na bekonya bɛ bɔne nanwo akatua.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 2:13">Bɛ nye gye ye nwo kyɛ bɛkɔbɔ ahohwibra eyia ketee. Bɛte dɛm ne ngekayɛɛ, na bɔ bɛkuro ala yeɛ ole kyɛ, bɛne ɛmɔ kɔbonu kodidi, na bafa ngyerɛkyerɛ bɔ ɔtte nahorɛ balaka-laka ɛmɔ. <verse eid="2PE 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 2:14" />Bɛle anyeɛ bɔ ɔsɛkye agyaa, bɛngora bɛndwe bɛ nwo bɛmvi bɔne nwo, na bɛlaka-laka bɛ bɔ bɛ bo timunne ne. Bɛ nye boro nikye, na bɛte ngwalaa bɔ badome bɛ. <verse eid="2PE 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 2:15" />Bayakyi nahorɛ atee ne, na bamini baafa Beor awa Balaam atee so, ye yeɛ né ye nye gye ye nwo kyɛ okonya akatua kofi bɔne nu ne. <verse eid="2PE 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 2:16" />Nakoso, bɛhwili ye nyunu wɔ ye mmerato nanwo, kaka bɔ ondwudwo fale sona konvi dwudwo hyirele ye, na osili sɔ diifo ne ngwaseasɛm né atee.<verse eid="2PE 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 2:17" />Sɔ mmenia hemɔ te abura bɔ nzue nne nu, ɔne munungum bɔ mvrama bɔ ye huu kɔ. Bɛ yeɛ basiesie awosii kabii bato bɛ berɛ ne. <verse eid="2PE 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 2:18" />Ofikyɛ bɛkeka edwirɛ mbiri-mbiri bɔ mvasoɛ biala nne so, bɛ́fa anwoɔnaen akɔnnɔ bɛlaka-laka mmenia, na bɛ bɔ bahwe bɛ nwo bafi abɔnefoɛ nwo ne, bɛfa b'ahohwibra ne bɛtwetwe bɛ. <verse eid="2PE 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 2:19" />Bɛhyɛ bɛ bɔ kyɛ bɛkɔma bɛ fahodie, nakoso bɛ bɔbɔ, bayɛ ngoaa bama nningyein bɔ waporɔ. Ofikyɛ sɛ nikye bie di ebie so a, sona ne ayɛ akoaa ama sɔ nikye ne. <verse eid="2PE 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 2:20" />Bɔ ɔte yeɛ ole kyɛ, sɛ bɛnate Awurade ne Agyenkwa Yesu Kristo nwo nimdeɛ so bɛtete bɛ nwo bɛfi wiase né abrabɔ fiɛ nanwo, na nziɛn, besa bɛfa bɛ nwo bɛkowura sɔ abrabɔ nanu maa ɔfa bɛ yɛ ngoaa a, ɔmaa bɛ tebea ne sɛkye koraa tra daa deɛ ne. <verse eid="2PE 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 2:21" />Ye de, sɛ bannwu tenenee atee ne a, ahaa ɔte pa tra kyɛ bekonwu ye, na basa bahwe bɛ nwo bafi ahyɛdeɛ krongron bɔ bɛfa bɛmane bɛ nanwo. <verse eid="2PE 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2PE 2:22" />Ɔba sɔ a, né bamaa sɔ anyandera he ayɛ nahorɛ: “Kyea fe a, osa kodi,” na “Ebia prako a, osa kɔbo asɛaa.”<verse eid="2PE 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2PE 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 3:1" />Aliemaa mɔ, ɛhe te krataa bɔ ɔtɔ so nyɔ bɔ metworɔ mebrɛ ɛmɔ ɔ. Na kyɛbɔ nyɛle ye wɔ bɔ oli moa nanu ne, mefa mekaye-kaye ɛmɔ, na metwe ɛmɔ adwene mesie edwirɛ so, <verse eid="2PE 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 3:2" />ná wamaa ɛmɔ akaye edwirɛ bɔ adiifoɛ bɔ bɛte krongron nemɔ hane,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Hyɛle ye nwo ngɔm.”</char></note> ɔne ahyɛdeɛ bɔ Awurade ne Agyenkwa nate asomafoɛ naso hane ne. <verse eid="2PE 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 3:3" />Ɛmɔli moa bɛkaye ɛhe, awieɛ mmerɛ nanu ne, bɛbɔ bɛka ayinga koli b'akɔnnɔ si kɔgoro ɛmɔ nwo. <verse eid="2PE 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 3:4" />Bɛkɔha kyɛ: “Bɛhyɛle bɔ kyɛ ɔba, na ɔwɔ ni? Ofi mmerɛ bɔ yɛ nana mɔ wuli ne, kyɛbɔ nningyein te fi mmerɛ bɔ bɛbɔle aseɛ ne, sɔ ala yeɛ ɔte ɔ.” <verse eid="2PE 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 3:5" />Nakoso bahyɛ da babu bɛ nye bagua nahorɛ dwirɛ he aso kyɛ, ofi teteete ne, né anwuro wɔ berɛ, na Nyameɛ noa dwirɛ ti aseɛ fili nzue nanu wale, na nzue apɛ ye nwo ayia; <verse eid="2PE 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 3:6" />na ɔnate so ala yeɛ nzue yi sɛkyele wiase bɔ né ɔwɔ berɛ sɔ mmerɛ ne. <verse eid="2PE 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 3:7" />Na sɔ dwirɛ komapɛ nala so yeɛ wasiesie anwuro ne aseɛ bɔ ɔwɔ berɛ ne wama see, na ɔfa nwondɛ kyẽa bɔ okobu atɛn na wasɛkye abɔnefoɛ ne.<verse eid="2PE 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 3:8" />Aliemaa mɔ, nnɛmaa ɛmɔ wora fi ɛhe, Awurade nye so de, ɛlɛho te kyɛ afoɛ 1,000, na afoɛ 1,000 koso te kyɛ ɛlɛho. <verse eid="2PE 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 3:9" />Awurade ngyɛ ye bɔhyɛ nwo, kyɛbɔ ebiemɔ adwene yɛ bɛ kyɛ wahyɛ ne, mmom wanya ɛmɔ nwo aboterɛ, ofikyɛ onguro kyɛ sona biala kɔsɛkye, bɔ okuro yeɛ ole kyɛ ebiala kɔsakra y'adwene. <verse eid="2PE 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 3:10" />Awurade kyẽa ne kɔwa te kyɛ awieniɛ, na enu yeɛ anwuro kɔbobɔ nu kuru-dudu kɔpɛ nu, ná nningyein bɔ wayɛ hye paa ne kohuro, na aseɛ ne, ɔne enu nningyein bɔ wafea namukoraati nwo kɔla berɛ.<verse eid="2PE 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 3:11" />Ɔnate kyɛ ɛhe amukoraati kɔsɛkye nati, mmenia beni yeɛ odikyɛ ɛmɔyɛ ɔ? Odikyɛ ɛmɔma ɛmɔ abrabɔ nwo te, na ɛmɔfa nyamesom pa bɛtena ase, <verse eid="2PE 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 3:12" />mmerɛ bɔ ɛmɔ nwondɛ, na ɛmɔma Awurade kyẽa ne ba ndɛ wɔ ɛmɔ adwene nu ne. Sɔ kyẽa ne, see kɔtɔ anwuro nu kɔyera ye, na nningyein bɔ ɔwɔ nu namukoraati kohuro. <verse eid="2PE 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 3:13" />Na kyɛbɔ wahyɛ bɔ ne, yɛnwondɛ anwuro foforɛ ne aseɛ foforɛ, na ɛhene anu yeɛ tenenee kɔtena ɔ.<verse eid="2PE 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 3:14" />Ye de, aliemaa mɔ, ɔnate kyɛ ɛmɔ nwondɛ ɛhemɔ nati, ɛmɔyɛ bɔ ɛmɔ kɔhora biala maa onwu ɛmɔ kyɛ mmenia bɔ dɛm ne ngekayɛɛ biala nne ɛmɔ nwo, bɔ ɛmɔte asomdwie nu ɔ. <verse eid="2PE 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 3:15" />Afei koso, ɛmɔnwu ye kyɛ, aboterɛ bɔ Awurade anya ye ne kɔmaa yekonya ngoa, na sɔ ala yeɛ yɛliema Paul bɔ yɛdɔ ye ne nate nyanza bɔ bafa bama ye naso hworɔ brɛle ɛmɔ ne. <verse eid="2PE 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 3:16" />Ɔhane ɛhemɔ nwo dwirɛ kyɛbɔ ɔyɛ ye wɔ ye ngrataa namukoraati nu ne. Nakoso ɛyɛ a né ɔyɛ se kyɛ yɛkɔte ye dwirɛ ne biemɔ bo, na ɛhe yeɛ bɛ bɔ bɛssuane hwee, ɔne bɛ bɔ bɛ bo timunne ne kyirekyire nu a, bɛ kyeɛ-kyea ye, kyɛbɔ bɛyɛ Tworɔnzɛm bɔ waha ne, nakoso ɔfa bɛ kɔ sɛkyelɛ nu. <verse eid="2PE 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 3:17" />Yeti aliemaa mɔ, ɛmɔse ɛhe dada, yeti ɛmɔnea yé, ná mvomsoɛ bɔ mmeratofoɛ ne yɛ ne anlaka-laka ɛmɔ, na mmerɛ bɔ ɛmɔ bo atimu ne, ɛmɔ amvi ase. <verse eid="2PE 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 3:18" />Na mmom ɛmɔhɔ so benyi wɔ y'Awurade ne y'Agyenkwa Yesu Kristo adom ne nimdeɛ nu, Ye yeɛ anuonyam ha ye ɛnɛ, ɔne daa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 3:18">Amen.<verse eid="2PE 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 3" />
</usx>